# ── Large binaries — keep the repo about the documentation ───
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.tif
*.tiff
*.gif
*.zip
*.stl
*.3mf
*.step
*.f3d
*.mp4
*.mov

# ── Spreadsheets: superseded by markdown, kept on disk only ──
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv

# ...but everything in as-built/ is a SOURCE that its .md is generated FROM.
# Ignoring these loses the build record and keeps only the derived output.
!as-built/*.csv

# ── Python build artifacts ──
__pycache__/
*.pyc

